  "description": {
   "en": "Lee Jae-ha dreamed of becoming a successful designer — but just as things were looking up, he was falsely accused of plagiarism and his world came crashing down. \n\n\"If only I could start over… like in those web novels…\"\n\nAnd in the blink of an eye, he does. He opens his eyes and finds himself 10 years in the past, back in art school, with all his memories and work experience from the future intact. \n\nNow armed with both a second chance and real-world wisdom, Jae-ha is determined to do it all differently: Build a name for himself on campus Land a job before anyone else And most importantly, clear his name once and for all No more regrets. No more failures. \n\nThis time, he’ll paint his own masterpiece of a life."
  },
